[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15902.55, "timestamp": "04:25:02", "text": "あなたのビデオ関連に投資するつもりです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15904.71, "timestamp": "04:25:04", "text": "右？ほとんどの人はそれを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15906.229, "timestamp": "04:25:06", "text": "情熱。行きたい人は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15908.55, "timestamp": "04:25:08", "text": "それを深刻なこととして、独立した"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15910.55, "timestamp": "04:25:10", "text": "YouTuberは、たくさんのことをしなければなりません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15912.63, "timestamp": "04:25:12", "text": "物事、ですよね？たくさん売って、もっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15914.469, "timestamp": "04:25:14", "text": "プロ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15917.429, "timestamp": "04:25:17", "text": "えーと、YouTuberのマネージャーみたいな人が必要だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15920.309, "timestamp": "04:25:20", "text": "あなたのチャンネルを高いレベルに引き上げることができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15923.189, "timestamp": "04:25:23", "text": "高さ、スポンサーシップを提供します"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15924.87, "timestamp": "04:25:24", "text": "プロモーション用品など全て、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15927.05, "timestamp": "04:25:27", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "that's understandable but why are they hard?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15927.429, "timestamp": "04:25:27", "text": "あなたのつながりやその他すべて、たくさん"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15930.389, "timestamp": "04:25:30", "text": "あなたにとっての物。しかし、なぜ彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15931.99, "timestamp": "04:25:31", "text": "難しい？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15939.269, "timestamp": "04:25:39", "text": "どういう意味ですか？なぜ難しいのか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15942.95, "timestamp": "04:25:42", "text": "見つけるのが難しいから"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15944.449, "timestamp": "04:25:44", "author": "@mattmeownster", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_k0PVo4Ayjzf9FlRcdjZAQYBwK430_hLvWlP9jgikQjC65W-ONDWjkk4dykteuHJ96HgQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-